WEBVTT

00:48:58.782 --> 00:49:02.707
which you describe
as social or asocial jobs.

00:49:02.731 --> 00:49:05.907
And so if you put those two axes
opposite each other,

00:49:05.931 --> 00:49:07.755
you get this quadrant,

00:49:07.779 --> 00:49:09.887
and that has allowed you
to categorize jobs.

00:49:09.911 --> 00:49:12.053
And in the bottom left,

00:49:12.077 --> 00:49:15.656
which is the asocial and noncreative jobs,

00:49:15.680 --> 00:49:17.720
that is the real danger zone,

00:49:17.744 --> 00:49:21.458
where -- do not prepare
your kids for those jobs.

00:49:21.482 --> 00:49:24.181
And some examples of those jobs
that you do not recommend

00:49:24.205 --> 00:49:26.237
that as a parent you prepare your kid for,

00:49:26.261 --> 00:49:27.434
would include what?

00:49:27.458 --> 00:49:31.109
KFL: Well, it would include telemarketing,